DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
3085::$$$message_0020_0000_0000$$$::I see fallen leaves scattered around the yard, a sure sign that we're firmly into autumn.[lr]::
3086::$$$message_0020_0000_0001$$$::While I do think it's an elegant sight, it means I have to keep the yard tidy.[lr]::
3087::$$$message_0020_0000_0002$$$::The best time to do something is right when you think of it, so I'll take care of it while I'm still in the mood.::
3088::$$$message_0020_0001_0000$$$::"Hm, that should do it."[lr]::
3089::$$$message_0020_0001_0001$$$::I thought it would be hard to clean the entire yard on my own, but it wasn't that much work once I set my mind to it.[lr]::
3090::$$$message_0020_0001_0002$$$::Training with Saber is much more tiring, by comparison.::
3091::$$$message_0020_0002_0000$$$::"Still... I piled up the leaves, but what do I do with them now?"[lr]::
3092::$$$message_0020_0002_0001$$$::All of the fallen leaves are piled into one corner.[lr]::
3093::$$$message_0020_0002_0002$$$::The burnable trash isn't going to be collected tomorrow, so I don't know where to put them.[lr]::
3094::$$$message_0020_0002_0003$$$::Besides, it feels like a bit of a waste to throw all of the collected leaves and dead branches into the trash.::
3095::$$$message_0020_0003_0000$$$::"...Well, it is finally autumn."[lr]::
3096::$$$message_0020_0003_0001$$$::Luckily, I have everything I need.[lr]::
3097::$$$message_0020_0003_0002$$$::I did this several times when Kiritsugu was still here, so I'll try it again.::
3098::$$$message_0020_0004_0000$$$::"...Okay. I think I still remember how."[lr]::
3099::$$$message_0020_0004_0001$$$::We collected the fallen leaves to make a bonfire and roasted the sweet potatoes from the kitchen.[lr]::
3100::$$$message_0020_0004_0002$$$::All that's left to do is to relax while keeping a careful eye on the fire.[lr]::
3101::$$$message_0020_0004_0003$$$::Once it's about time, I remove the aluminum foil-wrapped potatoes.[lr]::
3102::$$$message_0020_0004_0004$$$::They're plenty hot even through my mittens. Now these are some proper roasted potatoes.::
3103::$$$message_0020_0005_0000$$$::"Hmm."[lr]::
3104::$$$message_0020_0005_0001$$$::I stuff my cheeks with roasted sweet potato.[lr]::
3105::$$$message_0020_0005_0002$$$::They're so delicious my cheeks could fall off, but somehow, it feels lonely roasting potatoes over a bonfire all by myself.::
3106::$$$message_0020_0006_0000$$$::"The house just had to be empty at a time like this..."[lr]::
3107::$$$message_0020_0006_0001$$$::The smoke from the bonfire slowly rises into the air.[lr]::
3108::$$$message_0020_0006_0002$$$::I hope someone else is here to do this with me next time...::

